# c07-paused-seek: section 7 C07 (H3) - first frame 1250/0/1, 2 suppressed ticks, then 1500/250/1
exit ok
frame 1250/0/1
frame 1500/250/1
count tickAttempts 3
count suppressedTicks 2
count emittedTickFrames 1
count publicUpdateAttempts 2
count publicUpdateSuccesses 2
count frameCount 2
# Section 7 C07 names the Paused x Running cell: the host transport stays Paused while a seek still
# samples through the SDK. The transport half is carried by host.command; the Running half is carried
# by the seek frame existing at all, since a seek frame is only produced by a real update.
require host.command index=1 line=3 verb=seek outcome=ok transport=Paused->Paused
require host.command index=3 line=5 verb=play outcome=ok transport=Paused->Playing
